OL,3,GNEWSAMan thanks medics after surviving
OL,4,Acardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cardiac arrest survivor has thanked
OL,7,Fthe ambulance crew that helped save his
OL,8,Flife.
OL,10,FKen Culley, from Windlesham in Surrey,
OL,11,Fsaid he remembered "being in a very
OL,12,Fdark place" and that, next thing he
OL,13,Fknew, he was in the back of an
OL,14,Fambulance.
OL,16,FThere Culley grabbed one of the crew's
OL,17,Farms and said he was "going to go now"
OL,18,Fbefore having a cardiac arrest. His
OL,19,Fheart was restarted with one
OL,20,Fdefibrillator shock, according to South
OL,21,FEast Coast Ambulance Service (Secamb).
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
