OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan thanks medics after surviving
OL,4,Acardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Thanks to your professionalism and
OL,7,Fexpert skills, and the crash team who
OL,8,Foperated on me at Frimley [Park
OL,9,FHospital], I'm still here and able to
OL,10,Fsay thank you," he said to the medics
OL,11,Fwhen they were reunited.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
